.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
.TH OCTA-SESSION-CHECK 1 "" "OCTA-CAPTURE @PROJECT_VERSION@" "OCTA-CAPTURE Manual"
.SH NAME
octa\-session\-check \- check shared CTRL queries and meter notifications
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBocta-session-check\fR [CTRL-PORT]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Developer check that enables input meters, interleaves eight bulk queries with
four same-value writes of the current input-1 Mixer-A pan, validates complete
state preservation, disables meters and checks the trailing notification queue.
This performs real idempotent device writes and needs exclusive CTRL access.
.PP
The default CTRL MIDI port is hw:CARD=OCTACAPTURE,DEV=0,SUBDEV=1. Close other control-panel/CTRL clients before opening it. Audio streaming is independent of this connection.

.SH EXIT STATUS
Zero indicates success; nonzero indicates a usage, device or operation error.
.SH SEE ALSO
octa-capture(1), octa-status(1), octa-preset(1)
